<section lang="en"><h2>How booking information is used</h2>
@if(app()->environment('local', 'testing'))<p>Use fictional names and contact details in this local demonstration.</p>@endif
<p>Your name and phone number (Hong Kong +852 or mainland China +86) identify your patient record and booking. Email is optional and can be used for appointment notifications. Opting into WhatsApp appointment messages enables confirmations and reminders once the channel is connected.</p>
<p>Authorised branch and head-office staff use booking information for visits, billing and follow-up. Configured messaging providers process the contact details and message content required for delivery. Promotional messages require a separate subscription.</p></section></main></body></html>
